" bacnet | BIP 10.0.0.1:47808 | up | READ-ONLY | drop 0                   ? help "
"┌ Device┌ Help (? or Esc to close) ────────────────────────────────────┐───────┐"
"│  Insta│ Global                                                       │  Seen │"
"│> 1001 │   ?             Show or hide this help                       │  2s   │"
"│  1002 │   q             Quit                                         │  2s   │"
"│  1003 │   Ctrl-C        Cancel the running operation; twice quits    │  2s   │"
"│  1004 │   L             Show or hide the log pane                    │  2s   │"
"│  2001 │   p  c  x       Profiles; connect; disconnect/cancel         │  7s   │"
"│       │ Devices                                                      │       │"
"│       │   d  Enter      Who-Is form; browse the selected device      │       │"
"│       │   Up Down j k   Move; PgUp PgDn Home End jump                │       │"
"│       │   s  S          Next sort column; reverse the order          │       │"
"│       │   /             Filter rows; Esc clears the filter           │       │"
"│       │ Browser                                                      │       │"
"│       │   Tab  Enter    Next pane; read the selected object          │       │"
"│       │   /  r  Esc     Filter objects; read again; back             │       │"
"│       │ Who-Is form                                                  │       │"
"│       │   Tab Up Down   Next or previous field                       │       │"
"│       │   Left Right    Change the scope (also Space)                │       │"
"│       │   Enter         Send; Enter again confirms a warning         │       │"
"│       │   Esc           Close the form                               │       │"
"│       │                                                              │       │"
"└ Who-Is│ READ-ONLY: discovery, reads and finite FD registrations.     │───────┘"
"        └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘        "
